-Germain\n\nCheat your way to the top of 18th-century French society. Master deceptions using card marking, false shuffles, deck switching, false deals, and more! Use your ill-gotten gains to buy your way into the closed world of high-stakes tables.\n\nUncover a conspiracy as you climb from local card parlors to the King's table. A word of advice: Don't get caught. Your fellow gamblers do not take kindly to cheats...\n\nTravel through 18th century France and discover small towns, remote mansions, and luxurious lounges.", "summary": "Card Shark is an adventure game full of cunning, intrigue, and delectable deceit. Enter a world where you\u2019ll need to play your opponents better than you play your cards. Cheat your way to the top of 18th-century French society. Master deceptions using card marking, false shuffles, deck switching, false deals, and more! Use your ill-gotten gains to buy your way into the closed world of high-stakes tables. Card Shark is a new adventure that\u2019s all about playing your cards right.", "themes": [{"id": 22, "name": "Historical"}, {"id": 31, "name": "Drama"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/card-shark", "videos": [{"id": 39543, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "FwD0wsZV44U", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FwD0wsZV44U", "title": "Card Shark | Nintendo Switch & PC | 2021", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/FwD0wsZV44U/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 68294, "name": "Release Date Trailer", "video_id": "6ARLZYZvKm0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6ARLZYZvKm0", "title": "Card Shark | Available June 2 on PC & Nintendo Switch", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/6ARLZYZvKm0/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 69372, "name": "Launch Trailer", "video_id": "oaMpx583s_Y", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oaMpx583s_Y", "title": "Card Shark - Launch Trailer - Nintendo Switch", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/oaMpx583s_Y/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}